---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  wide
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact Dr. Ian Helfrich about private quantitative coaching, institutional training, economic research, collaboration, or speaking."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
    <h1>Use the route that gets you a useful answer.</h1>
    <p class="kicker">Based in Atlanta and working remotely with students, researchers, professionals, and organizations worldwide.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section compact">
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Private coaching</h3>
        <p>For econometrics, statistics, economics, finance, code, a research project, or a structured intensive.</p>
        <a class="card-arrow" href="/work-with-me#inquiry">Use the inquiry form →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Departments & organizations</h3>
        <p>For workshops, cohort training, custom curriculum, methodological office hours, or an institutional scope.</p>
        <a class="card-arrow" href="/work-with-me#institutions">See institutional work →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="audience-card">
        <h3>Research, media & speaking</h3>
        <p>For scholarly collaboration, research discussion, interviews, invited talks, or commentary within my fields.</p>
        <a class="card-arrow" href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com?subject=Research%2C%20media%2C%20or%20speaking%20inquiry">Email directly →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compact" aria-labelledby="direct-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Direct</span>
        <h2 id="direct-title">Elsewhere online.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="credential-list">
      <li><strong>Email</strong><br /><a href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com">ianthelfrich@gmail.com</a></li>
      <li><strong>LinkedIn</strong><br /><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ian-helfrich" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ian-helfrich</a></li>
      <li><strong>GitHub</strong><br /><a href="https://github.com/ihelfrich" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@ihelfrich</a></li>
      <li><strong>Location</strong><br />Atlanta metropolitan area, Georgia</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine-print">Please do not send confidential student records, protected data, or proprietary datasets in an initial message. We can establish an appropriate transfer method after confirming fit.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-panel">
    <span class="section-label">Private instruction</span>
    <h2>Start with the problem, not a sales call.</h2>
    <p>The inquiry form asks for exactly what I need to assess fit and recommend a format.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href="/work-with-me#inquiry">Start an inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
